      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0881c5f109da37f8",
      "translationZh": "使用 Sentence Transformers 训练和微调重排序模型：介绍 Cross Encoder 模型，可在截断后的套娃嵌入生成候选短列表之后，用于第二阶段处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "27ecf04e6d7e2ac0",
