      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "183ee4f7696abb9c",
      "translationZh": "使用 Sentence Transformers 的多模态嵌入与重排序模型：在推理时使用多模态嵌入模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce1bd04155d5f663",
      "translationZh": "使用 Sentence Transformers 训练和微调多模态嵌入与重排序模型：展示了如何将 Matryoshka 训练应用于多模态视觉文档检索模型，并给出了各维度下的性能保留数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9f5d61a6b64a1c90",
      "translationZh": "使用 Sentence Transformers 以快 400 倍的速度训练静态嵌入模型：使用 Matryoshka 损失进行训练，因此这些模型在截断后也能保留大部分性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
